# Rust build / test artifacts — regenerated by `cargo build` / `cargo test`.
# Only the generated crate root (src/lib.rs), Cargo.toml, meta/, schemas/, the
# behavioural test (tests/) and the hand-authored examples/ are tracked.
#
# Cargo.lock is intentionally untracked: this is a library crate with no
# external dependencies to pin (only a relative path dep on the runtime).
/target
/Cargo.lock
